message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Diagnostic Clinical Microbiology: a Persian teaching handbook of diagnostic clinical bacteriology"
abstract: >-
  A Persian (Farsi) teaching handbook of diagnostic clinical bacteriology for
  microbiology residents: specimen-based protocols, organism identification,
  culture media, identification tests, antimicrobial susceptibility testing
  (CLSI and EUCAST) and quality control, with open-licence figures.
type: software
